      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "钱多多喜欢这只小狗，弟弟太高兴了！他说：“姐姐生日快乐，我爱你！”",
      "traditional": "錢多多喜歡這隻小狗，弟弟太高興了！他說：“姐姐生日快樂，我愛你！”",
      "pinyin": "qián duō duō xǐ huan zhè zhī xiǎo gǒu dì di tài gāo xìng le tā shuō jiě jie shēng rì kuài lè wǒ ài nǐ",
      "english": "Qian Duoduo liked the little dog. Her little brother was very happy! He said, “Big sister, happy birthday. I love you!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
