    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "钱多多笑了，她太高兴了！家人们也都很高兴，他们一起吃生日蛋糕。",
      "traditional": "錢多多笑了，她太高興了！家人們也都很高興，他們一起吃生日蛋糕。",
      "pinyin": "qián duō duō xiào le tā tài gāo xìng le jiā rén men yě dōu hěn gāo xìng tā men yì qǐ chī shēng rì dàn gāo",
      "english": "Qian Duoduo smiled. She was very happy! Her family members were all very happy. They ate the birthday cake together."
    },
