      "english": "Qian Duoduo loved her family. She loved Mom, loved her little brother, and loved Uncle Xie."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "现在她又有了一个家人——可乐！可爱的可乐！",
      "traditional": "現在她又有了一個家人——可樂！可愛的可樂！",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài tā yòu yǒu le yí ge jiā rén kě lè kě ài de kě lè",
      "english": "Right now, she had another family member—Cola! The adorable Cola!"
    },
