      "(16) I Love You Guys",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo liked the little dog. Her little brother was very happy! He said, “Big sister, happy birthday. I love you!”",
      "",
      "Mom said, “Happy birthday, Duoduo! Mom now knows that you don’t like to hear the four words ‘you’re the big sister’.",
      "I didn’t know this before. I’m sorry. You are my good child. Mom loves you!”",
      "",
      "Uncle Xie said, “Happy birthday! Good child!”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo smiled. She was very happy! Her family members were all very happy. They ate the birthday cake together.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo loved her family. She loved Mom, loved her little brother, and loved Uncle Xie.",
      "Right now, she had another family member—Cola! The adorable Cola!",
      "",
      "“I love you guys!!” Qian Duoduo said."
